DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
14287::$$$message_0112_0000_0000$$$::And so, the investigation reaches its end.[lr]::
14288::$$$message_0112_0000_0001$$$::Every phenomenon's convergent point, every probability's destination.[lr]::
14289::$$$message_0112_0000_0002$$$::The one and only definite key that would put an end to this whole affair.[lr]::
14290::$$$message_0112_0000_0003$$$::"...[se storage=se410.wav][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=-2]"[lr]::
14291::$$$message_0112_0000_0004$$$::To settle this long speculation.[lr]::
14292::$$$message_0112_0000_0005$$$::Yes.[lr]::
14293::$$$message_0112_0000_0006$$$::This is the only place where we can[line len=3]::
14294::$$$message_0112_0001_0000$$$::"Let's talk about the cultural festival."[lr]::
14295::$$$message_0112_0001_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri is the one who began to talk.[lr]::
14296::$$$message_0112_0001_0002$$$::She was consulting not as a kyudo club member, but as the representative of the athletic clubs.::
14297::$$$message_0112_0002_0000$$$::"Let us talk about the cultural festival."[lr]::
14298::$$$message_0112_0002_0001$$$::Issei is the one who began to talk.[lr]::
14299::$$$message_0112_0002_0002$$$::In order to make the cultural festival a success, he wanted to discuss with the athletic clubs that still hadn't reached an accord.::
14300::$$$message_0112_0003_0000$$$::"...Got it. Why don't you do it at my place then?"[lr]::
14301::$$$message_0112_0003_0001$$$::The one who shrugged while being sandwiched between the two was Tohsaka.[lr]::
14302::$$$message_0112_0003_0002$$$::Tohsaka, who just happened to be there, volunteered to be the mediator.::
14303::$$$message_0112_0004_0000$$$::"All right, if that's decided..."[lr]::
14304::$$$message_0112_0004_0001$$$::"I'm sorry, Emiya, but..."[lr]::
14305::$$$message_0112_0004_0002$$$::"Can you arrange for the tea on Sunday?"[lr]::
14306::$$$message_0112_0004_0003$$$::The three harmonized, and I could only nod.::
14307::$$$message_0112_0005_0000$$$::After this and that, to the present...[lr]::
14308::$$$message_0112_0005_0001$$$::In preparation for Sunday two days later, I purchase refreshments for the four of us and head to the Tohsaka house.[lr]::
14309::$$$message_0112_0005_0002$$$::This is very much against my will, but it's for the sake of my friend.[lr]::
14310::$$$message_0112_0005_0003$$$::Issei is at a disadvantage against that brutal pair.[lr]::
14311::$$$message_0112_0005_0004$$$::The only thing I can do is attend with him and create an environment for discussion beforehand.::
14312::$$$message_0112_0006_0000$$$::"Hey. I'm here, Tohsaka."[lr]::
14313::$$$message_0112_0006_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
14314::$$$message_0112_0006_0002$$$::There's no response, but I notified her about today.[lr]::
14315::$$$message_0112_0006_0003$$$::I have a lot of things, so I'll go in for now.::
14316::$$$message_0112_0007_0000$$$::"...Oh? Are you not here, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
14317::$$$message_0112_0007_0001$$$::She doesn't seem to be out in the yard either.[lr]::
14318::$$$message_0112_0007_0002$$$::I thoroughly look around the first floor, the basement, and the storeroom.[lr]::
14319::$$$message_0112_0007_0003$$$::I don't see Tohsaka.[lr]::
14320::$$$message_0112_0007_0004$$$::The door and windows were also carelessly open.::
14321::$$$message_0112_0008_0000$$$::"...Is she doing something in her room...?"[lr]::
14322::$$$message_0112_0008_0001$$$::She might have her hands full with a magecraft experiment.[lr]::
14323::$$$message_0112_0008_0002$$$::I go up the stairs and knock on the door of Tohsaka's room.::
14324::$$$message_0112_0009_0000$$$::There's no response.[lr]::
14325::$$$message_0112_0009_0001$$$::There's no presence of anyone inside either.[lr]::
14326::$$$message_0112_0009_0002$$$::The door is unlocked.[lr]::
14327::$$$message_0112_0009_0003$$$::...It's too careless.[lr]::
14328::$$$message_0112_0009_0004$$$::I slowly grip the doorknob and timidly pull it open.::
14329::$$$message_0112_0010_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14330::$$$message_0112_0010_0001$$$::Tohsaka is... not here.[lr]::
14331::$$$message_0112_0010_0002$$$::She's not sleeping or in the middle of changing.::
14332::$$$message_0112_0011_0000$$$::Is she really not here?[lr]::
14333::$$$message_0112_0011_0001$$$::Tohsaka isn't on the first floor or second floor.[lr]::
14334::$$$message_0112_0011_0002$$$::The owner of this room isn't here[line len=3]the windows are unlocked here too.::
14335::$$$message_0112_0012_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14336::$$$message_0112_0012_0001$$$::Even if it's Tohsaka, it's hard to think that she would run out leaving the windows, doors, and Bounded Field open.[lr]::
14337::$$$message_0112_0012_0002$$$::There are too many holes in everything even if it was her bad habit and worst failure.::
14338::$$$message_0112_0013_0000$$$::"...What happened...?"[lr]::
14339::$$$message_0112_0013_0001$$$::Her desk has been left a mess.[lr]::
14340::$$$message_0112_0013_0002$$$::The familiar treasure box has been pulled out of the corner of the room.[lr]::
14341::$$$message_0112_0013_0003$$$::On top of her desk is a tea cup that is half full.[lr]::
14342::$$$message_0112_0013_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
14343::$$$message_0112_0013_0005$$$::A suspicious point.[lr]::
14344::$$$message_0112_0013_0006$$$::Everything is unnatural, but if there is anything unnatural that's different than usual[line len=3]::
14345::$$$message_0112_0014_0000$$$::I wonder if I heard wrong.[lr]::
14346::$$$message_0112_0014_0001$$$::Ever so slightly[line len=3]I heard a voice saying, "Oh," from somewhere.::
14347::$$$message_0112_0015_0000$$$::"...No, that phrase is a bit..."[lr]::
14348::$$$message_0112_0015_0001$$$::There's no way.[lr]::
14349::$$$message_0112_0015_0002$$$::But, I feel like she was inside... I know that it's a stupid idea.[lr]::
14350::$$$message_0112_0015_0003$$$::That Tohsaka would be inside[line len=3][lr]::
14351::$$$message_0112_0015_0004$$$::...I'll try checking.[lr]::
14352::$$$message_0112_0015_0005$$$::I slowly open the lid and peek inside the opening.::
14353::$$$message_0112_0016_0000$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
14354::$$$message_0112_0016_0001$$$::"..."::
14355::$$$message_0112_0017_0000$$$::I close the lid.[lr]::
14356::$$$message_0112_0017_0001$$$::I rub my eyes.[lr]::
14357::$$$message_0112_0017_0002$$$::I take a deep breath and try facing reality head-on.[lr]::
14358::$$$message_0112_0017_0003$$$::"...All right."[lr]::
14359::$$$message_0112_0017_0004$$$::I pull myself together and try opening the lid one more time.::
14360::$$$message_0112_0018_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14361::$$$message_0112_0018_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
14362::$$$message_0112_0018_0002$$$::...We stare at each other for a few seconds.[lr]::
14363::$$$message_0112_0018_0003$$$::The hallucination in front of me seems embarrassed to have been found.[lr]::
14364::$$$message_0112_0018_0004$$$::"Teehee, are you surprised?"[lr]::
14365::$$$message_0112_0018_0005$$$::She shows her best forced smile.::
14366::$$$message_0112_0019_0000$$$::No way.[lr]::
14367::$$$message_0112_0019_0001$$$::There's no kind of ridiculous situation where Tohsaka would be inside.::
14368::$$$message_0112_0020_0000$$$::[font italic=true]She's swaying a lot![font italic=false][lr]::
14369::$$$message_0112_0020_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Yikes...![font italic=false][lr]::
14370::$$$message_0112_0020_0002$$$::I don't want to admit it, but is Tohsaka actually inside...!?::
14371::$$$message_0112_0021_0000$$$::"...What, why do you look like a depressed pulp magazine writer?"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
14372::$$$message_0112_0021_0001$$$::"Who is that? [wvl][se storage=se564.wav][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]Wait, what's going on!!??"::
14373::$$$message_0112_0022_0000$$$::[font italic=true]T-Tohsaka is really inside!?[font italic=false][lr]::
14374::$$$message_0112_0022_0001$$$::I stand there, dumbfounded[line len=3]and, as if my perspective has gone weird, a Tohsaka bigger than the box comes out from the inside.::
14375::$$$message_0112_0023_0000$$$::"Phew, I'm glad you came.[lr]::
14376::$$$message_0112_0023_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服06c(中) time=300]I didn't think that I'd be able to get out of the treasure box for a few more days at that rate.[lr]::
14377::$$$message_0112_0023_0002$$$::I look back and forth between Tohsaka and the treasure box.::
14378::$$$message_0112_0024_0000$$$::"...Oh, um, huh?"[lr]::
14379::$$$message_0112_0024_0001$$$::"Hmm... I thought that I should tidy up a bit, so I was cleaning the inside of the treasure box.[lr]::
14380::$$$message_0112_0024_0002$$$::I was propping the lid open with a support prop to make sure it didn't close."::
14381::$$$message_0112_0025_0000$$$::"A support prop... What is that?"[lr]::
14382::$$$message_0112_0025_0001$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服06b(中) time=300][say storage=cty0217_rin_0080 name=凛]Anyway, I was getting inside and doing all sorts of things."::
14383::$$$message_0112_0026_0000$$$::It seems like it goes without saying that the look of that treasure box and its volume are different.[lr]::
14384::$$$message_0112_0026_0001$$$::So[line len=3]::
14385::$$$message_0112_0027_0000$$$::"The support fell, and you got stuck inside?"[lr]::
14386::$$$message_0112_0027_0001$$$::"[line len=3]That's right.[lr]::
14387::$$$message_0112_0027_0002$$$::It's got quite some nerve to betray the trust of its owner, [cacheimage storage=凛私服06g(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服06g(中) time=300]I need to punish it later..."[lr]::
14388::$$$message_0112_0027_0003$$$::She's muttering some things that don't make any sense.[lr]::
14389::$$$message_0112_0027_0004$$$::...So, she was staying still, since she couldn't open it from the inside.::
14390::$$$message_0112_0028_0000$$$::"Well, that's what happened.[lr]::
14391::$$$message_0112_0028_0001$$$::It looks like you saved me, I was trying to see if I could get out somehow..."::
14392::$$$message_0112_0029_0000$$$::This is the support prop that betrayed Tohsaka[line len=3]this must be a treasure too, so wouldn't it get mad being used as something like that?[lr]::
14393::$$$message_0112_0029_0001$$$::When I pick it up, it's oddly heavy[line len=3]huh? Isn't this plastic?::
14394::$$$message_0112_0030_0000$$$::"The top is round, so it'll slip if you use this to prop it up. Isn't there something else[line len=3]"[lr]::
14395::$$$message_0112_0030_0001$$$::"H-Hey! [cacheimage storage=凛私服16b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服16b(中)]What are you doing, Shirou!?"::
14396::$$$message_0112_0031_0000$$$::"Oh, sorry Tohsaka, this is your[line len=3]"[lr]::
14397::$$$message_0112_0031_0001$$$::"Just put that away!"::
14398::$$$message_0112_0032_0000$$$::Tohsaka attacks me, trying to take it away from me.[lr]::
14399::$$$message_0112_0032_0001$$$::She could've just had me hand it to her calmly, but I flinch from her fierce look[line len=3]and trip and fall.::
14400::$$$message_0112_0033_0000$$$::"W-Wait, Tohsaka, don't push me so hard!"[lr]::
14401::$$$message_0112_0033_0001$$$::If you do that[line len=3]::
14402::$$$message_0112_0034_0000$$$::"Woah!"[lr]::
14403::$$$message_0112_0034_0001$$$::"Ah!"[lr]::
14404::$$$message_0112_0034_0002$$$::It would've been fine if only I fell in.[lr]::
14405::$$$message_0112_0034_0003$$$::I try to push Tohsaka away and pull my arm away as much as I can[line len=3]::
14406::$$$message_0112_0035_0000$$$::"Ow[line len=3]!"[lr]::
14407::$$$message_0112_0035_0001$$$::[line len=3]It has the opposite effect.[lr]::
14408::$$$message_0112_0035_0002$$$::The top of Tohsaka's head, who was repelled, crashes into the lid right above her and she falls straight down.::
14409::$$$message_0112_0036_0000$$$::"...Owww."[lr]::
14410::$$$message_0112_0036_0001$$$::The thing that hit my back hurt.[lr]::
14411::$$$message_0112_0036_0002$$$::In the darkness[line len=3]something soft and smooth is on top of my body.[lr]::
14412::$$$message_0112_0036_0003$$$::It's Tohsaka without a doubt.::
14413::$$$message_0112_0037_0000$$$::"[line len=5]Phew."[lr]::
14414::$$$message_0112_0037_0001$$$::I take a deep breath and try to calm my heart down.[lr]::
14415::$$$message_0112_0037_0002$$$::With the ability to switch gears this fast, Shirou Emiya is a dependable man even in a pinch.::
14416::$$$message_0112_0038_0000$$$::"All right, I'll explain, Tohsaka.[lr]::
14417::$$$message_0112_0038_0001$$$::It must be hard to understand, but it seems like we're both trapped inside."[lr]::
14418::$$$message_0112_0038_0002$$$::"Guh!"::
14419::$$$message_0112_0039_0000$$$::"Why are you so calm!?[lr]::
14420::$$$message_0112_0039_0001$$$::After banging my head like that[line len=3]!"[lr]::
14421::$$$message_0112_0039_0002$$$::"Sorry, I tried to at least get you out.[lr]::
14422::$$$message_0112_0039_0003$$$::It's the lid's fault!"::
14423::$$$message_0112_0040_0000$$$::I try to convince Tohsaka[se storage=se265.wav] who's going wild on top of my chest.[lr]::
14424::$$$message_0112_0040_0001$$$::[se storage=se232.wav]It must've hurt a lot, [se storage=se138.wav]as she's hitting my stomach like a sandbag with one-inch punches[se storage=se121.wav][line len=3]I hope [se storage=se082.wav]it hasn't turned into a bruise.::
14425::$$$message_0112_0041_0000$$$::"...Hey, Tohsaka. Are you satisfied?"[lr]::
14426::$$$message_0112_0041_0001$$$::"Yes, I've calmed down a bit. Give me that back."[lr]::
14427::$$$message_0112_0041_0002$$$::She snatches the wand back and flings it.[lr]::
14428::$$$message_0112_0041_0003$$$::It must be an item that's especially important... Is it a memorable item from her childhood?::
14429::$$$message_0112_0042_0000$$$::"Emiya..."[lr]::
14430::$$$message_0112_0042_0001$$$::She whispers near me, and I have trouble breathing.::
14431::$$$message_0112_0043_0000$$$::"My arm kinda... [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-4]hurts..."[lr]::
14432::$$$message_0112_0043_0001$$$::"Did you sprain it?"[lr]::
14433::$$$message_0112_0043_0002$$$::"No, my hand can't reach from this position... [cacheimage storage=凛私服02b(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服02b(近) time=300]Can you get the case from the pocket of my skirt?"::
14434::$$$message_0112_0044_0000$$$::"Yeah."[lr]::
14435::$$$message_0112_0044_0001$$$::I extend my arm[line len=3]oh man, I feel like I might accidentally touch her in the wrong place from this distance... No, calm down, calm down.::
14436::$$$message_0112_0045_0000$$$::"...Don't touch me in the wrong place, okay?"[lr]::
14437::$$$message_0112_0045_0001$$$::"The pocket... Oh, this."[lr]::
14438::$$$message_0112_0045_0002$$$::I was about to accidentally pat her butt.[lr]::
14439::$$$message_0112_0045_0003$$$::I pull out the case that rubbed against my fingers and pass it to Tohsaka.::
14440::$$$message_0112_0046_0000$$$::"All right..."[lr]::
14441::$$$message_0112_0046_0001$$$::I twist my body and distance myself from her.[lr]::
14442::$$$message_0112_0046_0002$$$::We can't be entangled forever... Wait, can this treasure box even fit the two of us...?::
14443::$$$message_0112_0047_0000$$$::"Tohsaka. How does this box work?"[lr]::
14444::$$$message_0112_0047_0001$$$::"It's just how it looks.[lr]::
14445::$$$message_0112_0047_0002$$$::The size doesn't matter, it's a refractive space that can fit whatever goes inside.[lr]::
14446::$$$message_0112_0047_0003$$$::Once you get stored, that's it. It's a box with some magic where you can't get out right away."::
14447::$$$message_0112_0048_0000$$$::"That's it once you get stored... There's no way to get out?"[lr]::
14448::$$$message_0112_0048_0001$$$::"There's no problem opening it from the outside, but it's hard to open it from the inside.[lr]::
14449::$$$message_0112_0048_0002$$$::It's the rules."::
14450::$$$message_0112_0049_0000$$$::"Rules? Rules of the treasure box?"[lr]::
14451::$$$message_0112_0049_0001$$$::"Of course. It's a treasure box, so it wouldn't be good if things came out on their own.[lr]::
14452::$$$message_0112_0049_0002$$$::This is the treasure box that my grandmaster, Zelretch, cherished. It goes without saying that the condition of the inside is perfect, right?"::
14453::$$$message_0112_0050_0000$$$::"Zelretch... So, the same kind as your Jeweled Sword?"[lr]::
14454::$$$message_0112_0050_0001$$$::"Yeah. It's a magic box made by the 2nd True Magic.[lr]::
14455::$$$message_0112_0050_0002$$$::The volume of the box is the same, and instead of increasing the space inside, it can store things by increasing or decreasing the volume of things. It might be the effect of that randomness, but the internal time is different from the outside world.[lr]::
14456::$$$message_0112_0050_0003$$$::One hour inside the box equals a day in the outside world. It's a weird comparison, but it's like cryosleep."::
14457::$$$message_0112_0051_0000$$$::"O-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-4]One hour is one day...!?[lr]::
14458::$$$message_0112_0051_0001$$$::So, if[line len=3]"[lr]::
14459::$$$message_0112_0051_0002$$$::If we're in here for three hours, then it'll already be Sunday.::
14460::$$$message_0112_0052_0000$$$::"That's right. If you don't want to become like Rip Van Winkle, all we can do is get out right away."[lr]::
14461::$$$message_0112_0052_0001$$$::Tohsaka sighs.[lr]::
14462::$$$message_0112_0052_0002$$$::It's only natural since she finally was able to get out, but she ended up right back to where she started because of my clumsiness.::
14463::$$$message_0112_0053_0000$$$::"...I get that it's difficult to get out.[lr]::
14464::$$$message_0112_0053_0001$$$::But, there's no security effect from the inside out, right? The box will break, but if we use offensive magecraft, then it might surprisingly[line len=3]"::
14465::$$$message_0112_0054_0000$$$::"Look, Emiya.[lr]::
14466::$$$message_0112_0054_0001$$$::For example, if we were locked inside a safe, what do you think would happen if we tried to set dynamite from the inside to try to escape?"[lr]::
14467::$$$message_0112_0054_0002$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
14468::$$$message_0112_0054_0003$$$::It goes without saying that we'll die from the explosion before the box even breaks.::
14469::$$$message_0112_0055_0000$$$::"First of all, it's impossible to blow off the lid with my level of magecraft.[lr]::
14470::$$$message_0112_0055_0001$$$::Although it would be different if we had my grandmaster's Jeweled Sword."[lr]::
14471::$$$message_0112_0055_0002$$$::"...Oh, okay. I see, that's why you've got those glasses."::
14472::$$$message_0112_0056_0000$$$::"What?"[lr]::
14473::$$$message_0112_0056_0001$$$::"They're a magecraft item, right?"[lr]::
14474::$$$message_0112_0056_0002$$$::"No, they're just fake glasses."[lr]::
14475::$$$message_0112_0056_0003$$$::"Huh? Then why did you[line len=2]"::
14476::$$$message_0112_0057_0000$$$::"Why? That makes me not want to explain."[lr]::
14477::$$$message_0112_0057_0001$$$::"...It's not a key to escaping?"[lr]::
14478::$$$message_0112_0057_0002$$$::"Of course not. If I had something like that, I would've gotten out on my own."[lr]::
14479::$$$message_0112_0057_0003$$$::It's a hopeless situation, but she's rather calm and composed.::
14480::$$$message_0112_0058_0000$$$::"...So then...[lr]::
14481::$$$message_0112_0058_0001$$$::This is seriously[line len=2]"[lr]::
14482::$$$message_0112_0058_0002$$$::"Yes.[lr]::
14483::$$$message_0112_0058_0003$$$::I don't want to say it, but we're seriously trapped.[lr]::
14484::$$$message_0112_0058_0004$$$::It's not my fault, but sorry for getting you involved in this, Emiya."::
14485::$$$message_0112_0059_0000$$$::Her apologizing voice is a bit feeble.[lr]::
14486::$$$message_0112_0059_0001$$$::She groans at the crisis that has appeared out of nowhere.[lr]::
14487::$$$message_0112_0059_0002$$$::We're in a confined, yet wide locked room.[lr]::
14488::$$$message_0112_0059_0003$$$::Tohsaka and I are both greatly troubled, wondering what we should do.::